@startuml WF01-actionhook-eval
!include ../includes/C4_Sequence_Macros.puml

title WF01 — ActionHook evaluator (shared pattern)\nARCH-HOOK-EVAL / ARCH-WORKFLOW

C4Seq_User()
C4Seq_WebUI()
C4Seq_API()
C4Seq_RBAC()
C4Seq_Business()
C4Seq_Data()
C4Seq_Postgres()
C4Seq_Audit()
C4Seq_OTEL()

note over seqUser, seqOTEL
  Canonical pipeline for domain mutations.
  Compose **HookEval** / **GateCheck** / **HookEffectsAfter**
  — do not copy-paste this into action diagrams.
end note

== Attempt action ==

seqUser -> seqWebUI : invoke domain action
ClientScopedQuery("POST|PATCH", "/clients/{clientId}/…")
seqAPI -> seqBusiness : onAction(action_id, subject, actor, payload)
ControlNote(seqBusiness, "AC-3, CM-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Business owns ActionHook evaluation under WorkflowProfile")

== RBAC (can attempt) ==

RbacCheck("{action_id}")
ControlNote(seqRBAC, "AC-3, AC-6", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Permission-tree RBAC is authoritative for verbs; gates add contextual denies")

== Load hooks ==

HookEval("{action_id}")
ControlNote(seqData, "CM-3, AC-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Profile ActionHooks supply ordered gates_before + effects_after")

== gates_before (ordered) ==

GateCheck("{gate_id_1}")
GateCheck("{gate_id_N}")
ControlNote(seqBusiness, "AC-3, AC-6", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Optional gates skipped when disabled on profile; RoleBinding fills approver slots")

== Mutate (action-specific) ==

seqBusiness -> seqData : apply mutation (under change_set)
seqData -> seqPostgres : INSERT/UPDATE … WHERE client scope
ControlNote(seqPostgres, "AC-3, CM-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "SoT write; client boundary + change_set nesting")
seqPostgres --> seqData : ok
seqData --> seqBusiness : result

== effects_after ==

HookEffectsAfter("e.g. write_approval_record | clear_line_approval_if_content_or_pin | …")
ControlNote(seqBusiness, "CM-3, AU-2", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Effects are declarative per ActionHook; mint kinds drive clear/suspect/block")

== Audit ==

AuditLog("action.allow|deny", "subject")
ControlNote(seqAudit, "AU-2, AU-3, AU-12", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Auditable allow/deny with actor, action_id, gate outcomes")

seqBusiness --> seqAPI : DTO / deny
seqAPI --> seqWebUI : 2xx / 403/409
seqWebUI --> seqUser : result

@enduml
